{"unit_id":"hy-sde__dsh-web-search-public#card-zh","repo":"hy-sde/dsh-web-search-public","commit":"37d00da3a6a812b2a8180ecbdb5aa51083eeed53","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-public 是 DeepSeek Harness 的公开网页搜索 provider，注册到 ctx.web 并可由 bundle 设为默认搜索来源。一次搜索会并行请求 Startpage、DuckDuckGo、Ecosia、Google 和 Mojeek，解析网页结果、去重并按多个引擎的一致结果排序；单个引擎超时或失败时可使用其他引擎的结果，并以软硬期限限制等待时间。它适合希望在 DSH 中进行无需 API 密钥的网页检索的用户。搜索词会发送给配置的公开搜索引擎；无需额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:154-200","src/provider.ts:311-431","src/engines/index.ts:16-34","cordis.patch.yml:7-13"]}
{"unit_id":"hy-sde__dsh-web-search-public#card-en","repo":"hy-sde/dsh-web-search-public","commit":"37d00da3a6a812b2a8180ecbdb5aa51083eeed53","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-public adds web search to DeepSeek Harness. It queries five public engines in parallel, merges duplicate links, and ranks results by cross-engine agreement. Deadlines bound search time and results from working engines remain available if another fails. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:154-200","src/provider.ts:311-431","src/engines/index.ts:16-34","cordis.patch.yml:7-13"]}
